dwlm (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Niri-style scroll layout: infinite column strip with animated
    viewport, wheel/touchpad panning, per-column workspaces, consume/expel.
  * Hybrid TOML runtime config with SIGHUP hot-reload.
  * Floating windows with runtime rules and auto-centering.
  * Whole-column moves between monitors.
  * XWayland and foreign-toplevel-management support.

